### Message API Requests
# Note: All endpoints require authentication via JWT token in cookies
# To authenticate:
# 1. First run the login.http request to get a JWT token in cookies
# 2. Then run these requests - the JWT cookie will be automatically included

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006/api
@messageEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/message
@contentType = application/json

### Get users for sidebar
# Requires authentication via jwt cookie
GET {{messageEndpoint}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get messages with a specific user
# Requires authentication via jwt cookie
# Replace :userId with the actual user ID
GET {{messageEndpoint}}/:userId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Send message to a specific user
# Requires authentication via jwt cookie
# Replace :userId with the actual user ID
POST {{messageEndpoint}}/send/:userId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "text": "Hello, this is a test message!"
}

### Send message with image to a specific user
# Requires authentication via jwt cookie
# Replace :userId with the actual user ID
# Replace the image value with a base64 encoded image
POST {{messageEndpoint}}/send/:userId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "text": "Here's an image for you!",
    "image": "base64EncodedImageString"
}

###
